     {
      "text": "Trent achieved a 3-year revenue CAGR of 34.5% and PAT CAGR of 63.5%, reaching TTM revenue of ₹20,946 Cr and PAT of ₹1,814 Cr.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Operating margin improved from 13.5% to 18.7% over three years, and ROCE stands at 28%.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Debt-to-equity is low at 0.37, and operating cash flow covered PAT 1.2x over the last three years.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "bear": [
     {
      "text": "Return on equity is not disclosed (n/a), making it difficult to evaluate capital efficiency for shareholders.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Quarterly PAT fluctuated between ₹373 Cr and ₹518 Cr over the last four quarters, signaling earnings volatility.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "The company's operations are confined to India with no international presence mentioned, concentrating geographic risk.",
